{"1839020": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "O.U.T.T.", "steam_appid": 1839020, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sao Paulo, 22nd century, <strong>technology</strong> has merged with concepts that would be considered <strong>magic</strong> in our time. This breakthrough could greatly increase quality of life and the lifespan of the population. However, after starting the human trials a few people starting developing strange and severe side effects from an unknown source that can even be responsible for their deaths. Is there someone behind it? What is their agenda? Will you be able to uncover what is behind this? <strong>Can you stop it?</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>O.U.T.T. is a 3D turn-based puzzle-adventure game with a deep narrative, multiple endings, challenging puzzles with a retro futuristic cyber soulpunk aesthetic in a pre-dystopic future.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Beware the enemies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat or escape several enemies with different behaviors including extra planar entities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1839020/extras/782e1ab9043b0271df735aaee3c57074.poster.avif?t=1780585276\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1839020/extras/782e1ab9043b0271df735aaee3c57074.webm?t=1780585276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1839020/extras/782e1ab9043b0271df735aaee3c57074.mp4?t=1780585276\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Challenging puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use lever, buttons, light emitters, mirrors and sensor, and even hack computers with a 3D tetri